{
 "//": [
  "Hearth Desktop Mode on KWin: Mantel's keyboard shortcuts (the same as labwc/rc.xml's, test_kwin_windows.py checks).",
  "hearth-kwin-bridge puts them in KWin's hearthwindows script, which registers each with KWin (registerShortcut,",
  "named \"Hearth <id>\", so a key someone changes in KWin's shortcut settings stays changed). \"run\": the same command",
  "as labwc's (run by the bridge with sh -c). \"win\": done by the script itself (snapping, desktops, closing).",
  "\"kwinOwn\": keys KWin's own actions already do the same way (xdg/kglobalshortcutsrc sets the ones that need it).",
  "\"skipped\": labwc keys that have no job under KWin."
 ],
